---
title: "init (Sui Move Concepts: Module Initializer)"
---
stateDiagram-v2
    direction TB
    [*] --> q_publish: module published to Sui storage
    q_publish --> q_check_init: check if init(ctx) function defined
    q_check_init --> q_run_init: init function exists
    q_check_init --> [*]: no init function, publish complete
    q_run_init --> q_create_cap: create ShopOwnerCap { id: object::new(ctx) }
    q_create_cap --> q_transfer_cap: transfer::transfer(cap, ctx.sender())
    q_transfer_cap --> q_create_shop: create DonutShop { id, price: 1000, balance: zero() }
    q_create_shop --> q_share_shop: transfer::share_object(shop)
    q_share_shop --> [*]: init complete - cap owned by publisher, shop is shared

    note right of q_run_init
        INV-001: init function is called exactly once at module publication time
        INV-002: init function cannot be called again after publication
        INV-003: init receives TxContext to create objects
    end note

    note right of q_transfer_cap
        INV-004: Capability pattern - ShopOwnerCap grants admin privileges
        INV-005: Cap is address-owned by the module publisher
    end note

    note right of q_share_shop
        INV-006: DonutShop is shared so anyone can interact with it
        INV-007: Initial balance is zero, price is set at init time
    end note
